# itself, in red, as the test def Venus_TestOutlineTop (Tests/Pickle/Mod/Defs), worn over a shirt. UnderWhere (underwear worn under the shirt) is the only clothing mod; APP, APP Utilities, AB, TailorMade and THIGAPPE are absent.
